<p class="eyebrow">Make room for a little kindness</p><h1>Offer equipment to a neighbor.</h1><p class="muted">Use sample content only. Submitted listings stay private until a moderator screens them.</p><div class="steps"><span class="active">1 · Describe</span><span>2 · Submit for review</span><span>3 · Connect</span></div><form id="donate-form" data-edit="" class="panel reading"><div class="form-grid"><div class="wide"><label>Listing title<input name="title" maxlength="90" required value="" placeholder="Example: Folding walker"></label></div><div><label>Category<select name="cat"><option >Walkers</option><option >Canes</option><option >Shower chairs</option><option >Commodes</option><option >Crutches</option><option >Manual wheelchairs</option><option >Other</option></select></label></div><div><label>Location<input list="east-bay-locations" name="city" required maxlength="100" value="" placeholder="ZIP code or town name" aria-describedby="location-help"></label><small id="location-help">Enter a ZIP code (for example, 94612) or town name (for example, Oakland). Do not enter a street address.</small></div><div><label>Gift or loan<select name="kind"><option value="gift">Free gift to keep</option><option value="loan" >Free loan (design simulation)</option></select></label></div><div id="loan-until-field" hidden><label>Loan Until<input type="date" name="loanUntil" min="2026-10-16" value="" disabled aria-describedby="loan-until-help"></label><small id="loan-until-help">Choose the day, month and year the loan must end. Required for loans only. Current sample date: 2026-10-16.</small></div><div><label>Condition<select name="condition"><option >New</option><option selected>Gently used</option><option >Good</option><option >Requires Repairs</option></select></label></div><div><label>Manufacturer / model<input name="model" required value="Unknown" maxlength="80"></label></div><div class="wide"><label>Description<textarea name="desc" required maxlength="500" placeholder="Provide dimensions, weight, capacity, folding or not, and any other information that may be useful to the recipient."></textarea></label></div><div class="wide"><label><input type="checkbox" name="noDefects" required> This equipment is not missing any parts</label></div><div class="wide"><label><input type="checkbox" name="fullyFunctional"> This equipment is fully functional</label></div><div><label>Modifications<textarea name="mods" required>None known</textarea></label></div><div><label>Cleaning status<select name="clean"><option>Cleaned by donor</option><option>Not cleaned</option><option>Unknown</option></select></label></div><div><small id="pickup-help">Suggest a public place and daytime for pick up.</small></div></div><label>Sample photos — select 1 to 5</label><p><small>These stand in for photos. Real uploads and metadata processing are not enabled.</small></p><div class="photo-choices"><label><input type="checkbox" name="photos" value="0" checked><img src="/prototype-assets/0.svg" alt="Sample equipment view 1">View 1</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="photos" value="1" ><img src="/prototype-assets/0.svg" alt="Sample equipment view 2">View 2</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="photos" value="2" ><img src="/prototype-assets/0.svg" alt="Sample equipment view 3">View 3</label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="free" required> <span>I am authorized to offer this item, and it is completely free.</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="truth" required> <span>The above disclosures are truthful to the best of my knowledge</span></label><p class="error-text" id="form-error" role="alert"></p><div class="actions"><button class="primary" type="submit">Submit for review</button><button class="" data-action="filldonor" data-id="">Fill sample details</button></div><small>Public fields cannot include private contact or address details. Private donor contact would come from the verified account. Category configuration and territory enforcement await approved policies.</small></form>
